Hi Nicholas,

The Wikipedia page on OpenRISC has a section on commercial
implementations:

  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenRISC#Commercial_implementations

It might be missing some very recent ones.

> Are there “RedHat” analogues for OpenRISC and/or other “Open 
